The draft holds up well with someone who knows Druski's career. I checked the main Diary of a CEO quotes against the transcript, and the Rolling Stone and TIME quotes against the articles; they all match. It doesn't flatter him either: the whiteface sketches, the livestream incident with the nine-year-old, the scamming year and his shrug at the concussion-sketch critics are all on the page.

